VALUES ('Visit Changing Ireland in Moyross, Limerick!', 'visit-us-in-moyross-limerick', '<p>Address: &#8216;Changing Ireland’, Moyross Community Hub, Moyross, Limerick, V94 V0NP.</p>
<p>To arrange a visit, email editor@changingireland.ie, or call the community hub&#8217;s reception desk on 061-326057.</p>
<p>Find us on Google maps: <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/XkaHmkjVAVDcPQiN7">https://maps.app.goo.gl/XkaHmkjVAVDcPQiN7</a>.</p>
<figure aria-describedby="caption-attachment-254190"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/XkaHmkjVAVDcPQiN7" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/CI-in-Lim-map-e1713801206903.png" alt="" width="1384" height="793" srcset="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/CI-in-Lim-map-e1713801206903.png 1384w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/CI-in-Lim-map-e1713801206903-300x172.png 300w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/CI-in-Lim-map-e1713801206903-1024x587.png 1024w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/CI-in-Lim-map-e1713801206903-768x440.png 768w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2011/05/CI-in-Lim-map-e1713801206903-1080x619.png 1080w" sizes="(max-width: 1384px) 100vw, 1384px" /></a><figcaption><em>• Changing Ireland’s office in Limerick city.</em></figcaption></figure>
<figure aria-describedby="caption-attachment-254187"><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/XkaHmkjVAVDcPQiN7" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Visit-Changing-Ireland-in-Moyross-Limerick-3.png" alt="" width="1012" height="792" srcset="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Visit-Changing-Ireland-in-Moyross-Limerick-3.png 1012w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Visit-Changing-Ireland-in-Moyross-Limerick-3-300x235.png 300w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Visit-Changing-Ireland-in-Moyross-Limerick-3-768x601.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1012px) 100vw, 1012px" /></a><figcaption><em>• From Thomond Park to Changing Ireland&#8217;s office.</em></figcaption></figure>
<p><a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/XkaHmkjVAVDcPQiN7" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Moyross-Community-Hub-2.jpg" alt="" width="960" height="719" srcset="https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Moyross-Community-Hub-2.jpg 960w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Moyross-Community-Hub-2-300x225.jpg 300w, https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/Moyross-Community-Hub-2-768x575.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px" /></a></p>
<p><em>• Moyross Community Hub, home to Changing Ireland.</em></p>', 'Visit ‘Changing Ireland’!', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Visit-Changing-Ireland-in-Moyross-Limerick-2-cropped.png', '', '[{"slug":"uncategorized","title":"Uncategorized"}]', '[]', '', 292, 1, '2024-04-04T11:49:00Z', '2024-04-22T16:09:42Z', '2024-04-04T11:49:00Z')
