<p>The funding has been allocated by providing a baseline amount to each area and allocating the remainder based on the population and disadvantage level in each local authority area.</p>
<p>The funding is administered on behalf of the Department of Rural and Community Development locally by <a href="https://www.gov.ie/en/policy-information/f4022e-local-community-development-committees-lcdcs/">Local Community Development Committees</a> (LCDCs) across the country, with support from their Local Authority. Applications for funding can be made to the relevant LCDC. Contact details for LCDCs are available <a href="https://www.gov.ie/en/publication/38066e-local-community-development-committees-list/">here</a>.</p>
